factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The draft states the teacher was arrested 'Friday' (வெள்ளிக்கிழமை) in the reel script, which matches the article, so no issue there; however the slide 'எப்படித்' is an ungrammatical/incomplete Tamil word (should be 'எப்படி'), which has no clear meaning as a heading.
  The slide line 'போலீஸார் வழக்குப் பதிவு செய்து பள்ளியில் விசாரணை' and the reel script say the investigation was carried out at the school; the article says police went to the school for investigation, so this is consistent, but the reel script mixes the complaint date-less action and arrest into one unclear sequence.
  The caption and reel script say the complaint was filed by parents at 'கோவை மேற்கு அனைத்து மகளிர் காவல் நிலையம்' as in the article, but the slide shortens it to 'கோவை மேற்கு மகளிர் காவல் நிலையம்', dropping the word 'அனைத்து' (all-women), a minor inconsistency.
  The caption adds a claim that police 'தெரிவித்தனர்' (said) that the harassment was confirmed in the school, which the article does not attribute to the police speaking publicly; this is an added attribution.
  The English line 'Coimbatore govt school teacher arrested under POCSO | Coimbatore news' is part of the caption and is not a claim needing checking beyond the article, which supports the arrest under POCSO.
